WEBVTT

00:00:09,070 --> 00:00:13,070
Is there an oatmeal that is good for you?

00:00:13,070 --> 00:00:18,070
Well, I wouldn't say any oatmeal is bad for you,

00:00:18,070 --> 00:00:22,070
except what you really have to be careful with oatmeal is okay.

00:00:22,070 --> 00:00:24,070
Going back to the gluten issue.

00:00:24,070 --> 00:00:27,070
All oatmeal is going to be cross-contaminated with gluten,

00:00:27,070 --> 00:00:30,070
unless it says it's gluten-free oatmeal.

00:00:30,070 --> 00:00:37,070
So because oats and wheat are typically stored in the same storehouses,

00:00:37,070 --> 00:00:41,070
you're going to have cross-contamination on gluten to oatmeal.

00:00:41,070 --> 00:00:44,070
So technically, oatmeal has gluten in it,

00:00:44,070 --> 00:00:46,070
but it's going to be cross-contaminated.

00:00:46,070 --> 00:00:50,070
Secondly, oatmeal, unless it says organic,

00:00:50,070 --> 00:00:55,070
is definitely going to be filled with glyphosate.

00:00:55,070 --> 00:01:02,070
So you should not be eating any non-organic oatmeal.

00:01:02,070 --> 00:01:04,070
So if you're staying off of gluten,

00:01:04,070 --> 00:01:08,070
you should be eating gluten-free organic oatmeal.

00:01:08,070 --> 00:01:11,070
You should not be eating non-organic oatmeal

00:01:11,070 --> 00:01:15,070
because it is definitely going to be related with glyphosate.

00:01:15,070 --> 00:01:19,070
And glyphosate is definitely a driver of cancer.

00:01:19,070 --> 00:01:24,070
So if it's organic and it's gluten-free,

00:01:24,070 --> 00:01:28,070
then by all means there's anything wrong with oatmeal.

00:01:28,070 --> 00:01:31,070
The other issue that you could have with,

00:01:31,070 --> 00:01:35,070
should everybody just be eating organic gluten-free oatmeal?

00:01:35,070 --> 00:01:38,070
Well, no, it's also got carbohydrate.

00:01:38,070 --> 00:01:43,070
So if you're trying to keep your glucose levels down,

00:01:43,070 --> 00:01:46,070
then you shouldn't be just eating the whole bunch of oatmeal, right?

00:01:46,070 --> 00:01:49,070
So you have to address that.

00:01:49,070 --> 00:01:54,070
Now, if a person has got low to average weight,

00:01:54,070 --> 00:01:57,070
or if a person is in cakexia,

00:01:57,070 --> 00:02:00,070
they're losing weight on a weekly basis,

00:02:00,070 --> 00:02:03,070
then oatmeal is one of the things that I recommend.

00:02:03,070 --> 00:02:06,070
But again, it's organic oatmeal that you're looking for,

00:02:06,070 --> 00:02:09,070
so it doesn't have glyphosate in it.

